  <book code="PHP" style="id">EN_KTLT kuf_Katu,⋅Western_ltr Wed Mar 05 2025 09:34:32 GMT+0700 (Indochina Time) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">Philippians</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thơ Phi-liip</para>
  <para style="toc2">Phi-liip</para>
  <para style="toc3">Php</para>
  <para style="mt">Phi-liip</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1" />Phaau-lô lơq Ti-mô-thê, dhơn ratơơq ưng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, pagơơi leq tabhơt manưih huuiq liêm kalóóng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, nek nôôq manưih huuiq liêm tơơt dhiq kanóón Phi-liip, kung palơq nôôq muk sư lơq chơp sưưq. <verse eid="PHP 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2" />Rââm ơơn phươk liêm lơq yươq rauha tââq Yaang Pleng, nek Ama lơq Chuôq nôôq he, nek Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, tơơt dhiq adhi anó.<verse eid="PHP 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3" />Aku ma-ơơn Yaang Pleng ưng aku dhiq dyóp rau lóóm hei ayô tơk leq adhi anó, <verse eid="PHP 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4" />kalóóng dyóp paraaq gavơh nhan ưng aku leq tabhơt adhi anó, taluôn tapôông paraaq gavơh nhan palơq lóóm marhaal marlaat <verse eid="PHP 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5" />Ơi taai rau tapâng phơn ưng adhi anó kalóóng Taruuih Liêm tââq tangêi tarnââp patơk xók ađôk; <verse eid="PHP 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6" />tââq huuiq mưng leq chênh rau ađô, kơi Yaang ơi tââp tarnââp têêng tarnêêng liêm kalóóng adhi anó e têêng paxong đóng patơk tangêi ưng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih; <verse eid="PHP 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7" />ting kơi palơq aku, alua nek rau chênh đaang buôn kanóq kơi achêk leq tabhơt adhi anó, taai aku jư adhi anó kalóóng lóóm ađêi, tabhơt adhi anó maar nek nôôq ting poor tarnêêng palơq aku tââq ơơn phươk liêm, miq kalóóng tarlêi xiêng klooiq ưng aku, palơq kalóóng rau paraaq paq lơq lêi alua leq Taruuih Liêm. <verse eid="PHP 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8" />Taai Yaang Pleng nek Yaang lalua ưng aku, n'đó kơi aku bhơt lóóm đương rââm tabhơt adhi anó palơq lóóm nh'nhơr bhlơng ưng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="PHP 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9" />Lơq rau aku gavơh nhan ađek nek lóóm tanhơr ưng adhi anó bhiêk hóói xưa bhlaai, bhiêk yuur tatrul dhaang lơh kalóóng bhriêl tabech palơq dyóp rau n'nal, <verse eid="PHP 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10" />buôn adhi anó ve chóóm lêi pâng n'đó rau nek liêm tââm, hơq đóng adhi anó bâân tabah sek lơq yươq dhiq trêh jươm đóng tơk tangêi ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih, <verse eid="PHP 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11" />bâân bing bhlaai pô pale ưng rau bhơt liêm đươi Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, malóóm tơk rau cha-iil tabah lơq rau babóóch haanh Yaang Pleng.<verse eid="PHP 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12" />Nhan móón adhi anó, aku kiêng adhi anó n'nal kơi nôôq rau vaaih tơk palơq aku nek lalua ơi yuur vaaih taai rau garuul tơk ưng Truuih Liêm. <verse eid="PHP 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13" />Tơk mơ, kalooiq klooiq ưng aku kalóóng Chuôq Paq Manưih ơi val kơi drêh dróói tơơt dhiq m'pơng tabhơt linh đương đong kuôn gamak palơq dyóp ngaai lââng, <verse eid="PHP 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14" />lơq nh'jang bơk adhi anó, đươi glóóng klooiq ưng aku, ơi mưng lóóm huuiq dhiq Chuôq, dhaang tabhlơng lóóm buôn truuih đuui taruuih Chuôq kơi yươq kakhin kapơn. <verse eid="PHP 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15" />Dhơ patơk mơ mưi phơn manưih truuih đuui Chuôq Paq Manưih taai makhinh lơq tarjeng tarjô, bơơi kung ve manưih truuih đuui palơq karnóq liêm, <verse eid="PHP 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16" />nek nôôq manưih taai lóóm tanhơr, n'nal kơi aku bâân chaleq patơơt đóng ââi paq Taruuih Liêm, <verse eid="PHP 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17" />bơơi nôôq manưih taai jahaam hiin kiêng ađêi giêl, piđó truuih đuui Chuôq Paq Manưih kơi kah bhơt lóóm, ngóq trul kơơq panhok karnóq leq glóóng klooiq ưng aku. <verse eid="PHP 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18" />Kơi achêk nek ng'kơi? Dhơ đóng nek tââq n'đó kơi, hamôôiq nek xanaan môôiq nek tapat dhalam, nek Chuôq Paq Manưih bâân truuih đuui, lơq aku bhuui marhaal leq rau ađek! Mat lââng, aku kung e bâân têêng đóng bhuui marhaal, <verse eid="PHP 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19" />taai aku n'nal kơi rau ađô e đââng rau paq jóói tơk đóng aku, đươi rau gavơh nhan ưng adhi anó lơq rau poor jóói tââq Yaang Liêm ưng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, <verse eid="PHP 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20" />ting kơi rau mamââk rââm đương lơq rau lóóm rââm ưng aku, ađek nek aku e yươq bâân têêng đóng kachiit mat kalóóng dhơ dharau chiên, bơơi grâ nhóól kalóóng dyóp rau, buôn xók ađôk kung kơi dhơ dhaxók, Chuôq Paq Manưih e bâân bhi payaal dhiq achak araang aku, dhơ dhakơi mamông môôiq chêt. <verse eid="PHP 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21" />Taai ting kơi palơq aku, mamông nek Chuôq Paq Manưih, lơq chêt nek rau malơơi. <verse eid="PHP 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22" />Dyơq la bhiêk mamông kalóóng ng'kar m'bech, nek ting kơi palơq aku achêk nek tarnêêng m'bhô yưưm malơơi đóng tarnêêng têêng, hayơq aku kah n'nal ađêi e lưa chââih n'đó hót. <verse eid="PHP 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23" />Aku tagliêq dhiq m'pơng bơơr hót. Xók ve rââm kiêng buôn yuur vôôiq lơq tơơt palơq Chuôq Paq Manưih, taai ađek nek rau liêm lơh lóng bơk, <verse eid="PHP 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24" />bơơi bhiêk tơơt lóóiq kalóóng ng'kar m'bech nek rau kơng lơh đóng adhi anó. <verse eid="PHP 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25" />Xók ơi huuiq tamưng rau ađek, aku n'nal kơi ađêi e tơơt lóóiq lơq dyơq tơơt kơơq palơq tabhơt adhi anó, taai rau gamak taha lơq rau bhuui kalóóng lóóm huuiq ưng adhi anó, <verse eid="PHP 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26" />buôn rau tarhơơnh ưng adhi anó kalóóng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih leq aku e xưa bhlaai dhiq tarnêêng aku tơk lum adhi anó machu dyơq. <verse eid="PHP 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27" />Chapiên ve rau adhi anó phaai mamông ng'kơi đaang palơq Taruuih Liêm ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih, buôn dhơ xók aku tơk lơq chamet lêi adhi anó môôiq xók kah ve mat, nek aku ve bâân xâng leq adhi anó kơi adhi anó dyương mưng kalóóng mưi lóóm kanóq, palơq mưi lóóm karnóq palơq tarjơl tajeng taai lóóm huuiq ưng Taruuih Liêm, <verse eid="PHP 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28" />lơq yươq bâân nôôq manưih jơl jaklâk têêng đóng kakhin kapơn kalóóng bhơt dhơ dharau. Ađô nek kanal leq rau hư jir đóng leq piđó, bơơi nek kanal leq rau paq jóói ưng adhi anó, lơq rau ađô tââq Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="PHP 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29" />Taai đươi Chuôq Paq Manưih, ơơn phươk ơi bâân đóng leq adhi anó eh mưi buôn huuiq dhiq Ađó, bơơi kung buôn đơơp jarnah taai Ađó, <verse eid="PHP 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30" />xók ve mađó rau tarjeng tarjơl hơq adhi anó ơi lêi dhiq aku, lơq ađôk dyơq xâng dhiq aku.<verse eid="PHP 1:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1" />Kơi achêk hayơq, la kalóóng Chuôq Paq Manưih ve n'đó rau tapoor lóóm, la ve n'đó rau tabhơơl lóóm tââq lóóm tanhơr, la ve n'đó rau tarnêêng kalóóng Yaang Liêm, la ve lóóm tanhơr lơq n'đó rau kayô ka-er, <verse eid="PHP 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2" />hayơq nek têêng padyóp lóóm bhuui marhaal ưng aku, ađek nek adhi anó ve markơi lóóm karnóq, xók ve markơi lóóm tanhơr, panjoop mưi kalóóng lóóm kanóq, kanóq tơk mưi leq. <verse eid="PHP 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3" />Kah têêng tarnêêng rau taai lóóm châq hiin hamôôiq taai bil liêm, palâh lóóiq, palơq lóóm pa-êêp, lêi manưih lââng bhi chap lơh ađêi, <verse eid="PHP 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4" />ting chanak óóq mưi kanóq tơk malơơi ưng ađêi kala, hơq dyơq malơơi ưng nôôq manưih lââng dyơq. <verse eid="PHP 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5" />Phaai ve lóóm karnóq kơi achêk kalóóng adhi anó, kung nek lóóm karnóq kalóóng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih,<verse eid="PHP 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6" />nek Yaang taluôn ve kalóóng a-ô Yaang Pleng,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:6">ơi kah lêi rau kơng phaai pei jư nek rau marđơq palơq Yaang Pleng.<verse eid="PHP 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7" />Klóóih dhiq ađek,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:7">Ađó ơi tư têêng đóng ađêi vaaih kagóh kagóói</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:7">xók pei xơp dyaang achak dhơn ratơơq,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:7">bâân n'niên kalóóng a-ô thê kơi akóón manưih,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:7">lơq bâân lêi kalóóng dyaang achak kơi mưi akóón manưih,<verse eid="PHP 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8" />Ađó ơi tư pa-êêp ađêi chok leq</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:8">xók đơơp huuiq bóóp patơk chêt,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:8">Patơk mơ chêt dhiq n'lóóng m'baang chatông.<verse eid="PHP 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9" />Taai kơi achêk, Yaang Pleng kung ơi padyók Ađó yaal bhlơng</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:9">lơq ơi đóng leq Ađó dhanóók m'piing dyóp rau dhanóók,<verse eid="PHP 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10" />hơq đóng xâng tơk dhanóók Chuôq Jê-su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:10">Dyóp tarkól dhiq pleng,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:10">dhiq katiêk, hót raal katiêk, phaai chakoh chok leq,<verse eid="PHP 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11" />lơq dyóp n'taak maar đơơp móón kơi Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih nek Chuôq,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:11">taval chô cha-iil tabah mađó leq Yaang Pleng, nek Ama.<verse eid="PHP 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12" />Kơi achêk hayơq, nôôq manưih nh'nhơr bhlơng ưng aku ơơi, ting kơi adhi anó ơi taluôn huuiq bóóp, xók kah chapiên tơơt kalóóng rau ve mat ưng aku, hơq xók ađôk dhaang bơk lơh kalóóng rau kah ve mat ưng aku, adhi anó nek phaai bhiêk têêng đuui ơơn paq jóói ưng ađêi palơq rau bhi kakhin lơq hayer papreh. <verse eid="PHP 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13" />Taai Yaang Pleng nek Yaang dyơq matêêng kalóóng adhi anó buôn lơq kiêng lơq têêng ting karnóq liêm ưng Ađó. <verse eid="PHP 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14" />Phaai têêng dyóp rau tarnêêng, hơq óóq m'bhoonh hamôôiq tarkaai tarlak, <verse eid="PHP 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15" />buôn adhi anó bâân val kơi nôôq panong akóón yươq dhiq chóóm jươm lơq sek liêm ưng Yaang Pleng, yươq madham madhôôn dhiq m'pơng mưi dhong nooi lơt môôp lơq huông hư, hơq dhiq ađek adhi anó dyóól brương kơi nôôq par-aang dhơu dhiq hóng katiêk, <verse eid="PHP 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16" />xók jư tamưng paraaq parmông, taai rau tarhơơnh ưng aku kalóóng tangêi ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih ađek nek ađêi ơi yươq mut kalóóng kah malơơi, kung yươq nhưh nhok kơi bil yưưm. <verse eid="PHP 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17" />Bơơi patơk mơ dhơ đóng aku bâân tantoh ahaam buôn havươch dhiq adhah bhanuôih lơq dhanah bhanuôih ưng lóóm huuiq adhi anó, nek aku bhiêk yayar marhaal, lơq ting tabhuui palơq, tabhơt adhi anó. <verse eid="PHP 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18" />Adhi anó kung kơi achêk, phaai yayar marhaal lơq ting tabhuui palơq aku.<verse eid="PHP 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19" />Kalóóng Chuôq, nek Chuôq Jê-su, aku rââm đâh pagơơi Ti-mô-thê vôôiq tham adhi anó, buôn aku kung bâân lêi yayar mamââk xók n'nal đââr xâng leq adhi anó. <verse eid="PHP 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20" />Taai aku kah ve ngaai lââng liêm lóóm kanóq kơi ađó achêk, nek manưih lalua lóóm karaang kanóq nôôq rau malơơi ting kơi palơq adhi anó, <verse eid="PHP 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21" />taai nôôq manưih lââng maar chik-chêk nôôq malơơi malaai n'tua, eh rau nôôq rau mađó leq Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="PHP 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22" />Bơơi adhi anó n'nal liêm charnap ưng ađó achêk, taai thê kơi akóón palơq akonh, ađó achêk ơi têêng yaauq đóng Taruuih Liêm kung palơq aku. <verse eid="PHP 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23" />Đóng hayơq aku rââm kayua ađó achêk dhalam xók aku n'nal rau tarnêêng ưng ađêi e n'đó kơi. <verse eid="PHP 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24" />Bơơi aku huuiq mưng dhiq Chuôq kơi chênh aku kung e đâh vôôiq tham adhi anó. <verse eid="PHP 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25" />Mat lââng, aku kanóq kiêng phaai pagơơi Ep-ba-phô-đich chô lóóiq leq adhi anó, ađó achêk nek manưih adhi anó lơq parjơơk marau tarnêêng kung nek parjơơk ting tajơl ưng aku, nek manưih đââng paraaq tââq adhi anó lơq nek manưih yaauq têêng đóng rau kiêng ưng aku, <verse eid="PHP 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26" />taai bâân n'nal kơi ađó bhơt lóóm đương rââm bâân tơơt palơq tabhơt adhi anó, lơq xâng đơơp ranguôq lóóm taai adhi anó ơi xâng kơi ađó achêk ka-ai pakhau. <verse eid="PHP 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27" />Taai pâng nek ađó achêk ơi pâng ka-ai đan chêt, bơơi Yaang Pleng ơi kayô ka-er ađó achêk, hơq eh mưi ađó achêk nek giêl, bơơi dyơq aku dyơq, buôn aku yươq đơơp ranguôq lóóm dhaang dyơq ranguôq lóóm. <verse eid="PHP 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28" />Đóng hayơq, aku tahươk tahââm kayua ađó achêk vôôiq, buôn xók lum lóóiq ađó achêk, adhi anó ve chóóm bhuui marhaal, lơq aku kung bâân yươq ranguôq lóóm. <verse eid="PHP 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29" />Taai kơi achêk, phaai pơh yaauq ađó achêk kalóóng Chuôq palơq tabhơt lóóm bhuui, palơq phaai ve lóóm bhi chap nôôq ngaai kơi achêk. <verse eid="PHP 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30" />Ơi taai tarnêêng ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih hơq ađó achêk patơk mơ menh chêt, xók boh parhââm parmông ađêi buôn ve chóóm têêng paxong phơn kah glêh kalóóng rau yaauq têêng ưng adhi anó niin đóng aku.<verse eid="PHP 2:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1" />Tatun kiêt, nhan móón adhi anó ưng aku, phaai bhuui marhaal kalóóng Chuôq. Ting kơi palơq aku, yươq rau nhok nhói rauriq xók xaraq lóóiq palơq nôôq rau ađô leq adhi anó, taai nek rau yươq rauha koom đóng adhi anó. <verse eid="PHP 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2" />Phaai hêch lêi kabhuh anuq, phaai hêch lêi nôôq manưih têêng tarnêêng môôp lơt, phaai hêch lêi pheep iêt ng'kar galơơk. <verse eid="PHP 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3" />Taai nôôq he đơơp pheep iêt ng'kar lalua, hơq nek nôôq manưih bhuôih haanh palơq Yaang Liêm ưng Yaang Pleng, tarhơơnh kalóóng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, lơq yươq rââm ganơơm dhiq manưih ti. <verse eid="PHP 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4" />Dhơ nek aku patơk mơ ve rau taai rââm ganơơm dhiq ng'kar m'bech. La ngaai lââng kanóq ve rau taai buôn ganơơm dhiq ng'kar m'bech, nek aku dyơq ve bơk lơh: <verse eid="PHP 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5" />aku đơơp têêng iêt ng'kar xók tangêi takóól, mađó dhanuôr I-sơ-ra-êên, kabhuh Bêên-ja-miin, manưih Hê-bơ-rơ, akóón ưng manưih Hê-bơ-rơ, leq gani, nek manưih Pha-ri-si; <verse eid="PHP 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6" />leq lóóm jêi tarang nek kóóp leng kabhuh akóón dhơn Chuôq; leq rau bhơt liêm ting gani hơq bâân đóók nek yươq dhiq trêh jươm. <verse eid="PHP 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7" />Dhơ kơi ađek, dhơ dharau mak rau biêh nek malơơi ting kơi palơq aku, nek ơi taai Chuôq Paq Manưih, aku ơi lêi piđó nek kah malơơi. <verse eid="PHP 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8" />Bơơi hayơq lơh achêk dyơq, aku patơk mơ lêi tabhơt maar nek kah malơơi ơi taai kiiq liêm lơh bhơt ưng rau đơơp n'nal leq Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, Chuôq ưng aku, taai Ađó hơq aku ơi đơơp bil tabhơt, alua, aku lêi piđó kơi xanaak nh'xók, hơq đóng aku bâân Chuôq Paq Manưih <verse eid="PHP 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9" />lơq bâân chêk-lêi kalóóng Ađó, eh rau taai ve rau bhơt liêm dhiq achak araang ađêi tââq gani bơơi nek rau bhơt liêm đươi lóóm huuiq dhiq Chuôq Paq Manưih, hơq nek rau bhơt liêm tơk tââq Yaang Pleng liêm tââm dhiq lóóm huuiq — <verse eid="PHP 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10" />buôn đơơp n'nal Ađó lơq mataai karơ rau mamông lóóiq ưng Ađó kung palơq marau tarnêêng kalóóng nôôq kadhaap jarnah ưng Ađó, xók bâân đââng tơk dhiq markơi palơq rau chêt ưng Ađó, <verse eid="PHP 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11" />dhơ palơq n'đó kơi kiq ađek, nek aku ve chóóm bâân tơk rau mamông lóóiq tââq kan chêt. <verse eid="PHP 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12" />Achêk eh rau nek aku ơi bâân pei kaliim ơi, hamôôiq ve bâân bhơt liêm ơi, bơơi aku xók viêng tapun ng'kơi đóng ađêi ve chóóm jeng pei kaliim hơq ơi taai ađek, aku kung ơi bâân Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih pei jeng. <verse eid="PHP 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13" />Nhan móón adhi anó, aku kah móón nek kala achak ađêi ơi bâân jeng. Bơơi aku bhiêk têêng mưi rau: xók havil vaq nôôq rau hót hóng hơq chavươh tơk nôôq rau hót lóóm, <verse eid="PHP 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14" />malóóm tơk kanóq têêng, aku xók viêng tapun đóng bâân kaliim haanh leq rau dhaloong tââq dhiq pleng ưng Yaang Pleng kalóóng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="PHP 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15" />Kơi achêk hayơq, tabhơt nôôq ngaai gamak taha maar kơng phaai kanóq kơi achêk, dyơq kơi la ve rau lââng adhi anó kanóq kơi lalêi kiêt, Yaang Pleng kung e pakah rau ađek leq adhi anó. <verse eid="PHP 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16" />Dhơ kơi ađek, nôôq he ơi bâân tơk n'đó mơ nek hayơq jađaang vôôiq ting mơ ađek.<verse eid="PHP 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17" />Nhan móón adhi anó, phaai val kơi nôôq manưih ting đuui aku, lơq phaai chamet lêi nôôq manưih xók mamông kalóóng dhanang achêk, ting kơi xamil ngil adhi anó lêi dhiq nôôq yi. <verse eid="PHP 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18" />Taai ve bơk ngaai, nek nôôq manưih hơq aku ơi đóók praaq palơq adhi anó, bơơi xók ađôk aku patơk mơ phaai nhiim hơq praaq, piđó dyơq mamông kơi manưih brau makhich palơq m'baang chatông ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih, <verse eid="PHP 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19" />Leq xariêq ưng nôôq manưih ađek nek chêt bil, chuôq ưng piđó nek luônh palung, lơq cha-iil tabah ưng piđó dhiq kalóóng tarnêêng têêng đaang kachiit mat ưng piđó, hơq nek nôôq manưih chapiên kanóq tơk nôôq tarnêêng hóng katiêk. <verse eid="PHP 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20" />Bơơi taai tanơơt pa-at manưih dhanuôr ưng nôôq he ơi ve dhiq pleng, hơq tââq dhiq ađek nôôq he puih lóóm rââm đương Yaang Trôông Paq, nek Chuôq, hơq Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, <verse eid="PHP 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21" />nek Yaang e tavaaih paxar achak araang êêp katưưiq ưng nôôq he val xar markơi palơq achak araang cha-iil tabah ưng Ađó, ting kơi rau matêêng ưng karơ mataai Ađó buôn pajaau dyóp rau leq ađêi.<verse eid="PHP 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1" />Kơi achêk nek, adhi anó nh'nhơr liêm lơq rââm hei ưng aku ơơi, lóóm bhuui lơq panơơng pơơng ưng aku, nôôq adhi anó nh'nhơr liêm ơơi, phaai bhiêk dyương tamưng kơi achêk kalóóng Chuôq.<verse eid="PHP 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2" />Aku mââl bhơơl Ê-vô-đi lơq mââl bhơơl Siin-ti-kơ ve markơi lóóm karnóq kalóóng Chuôq. <verse eid="PHP 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3" />Dhơ dhakơi, aku kung nhan anó, manưih mađó tarnêêng lalua dhalam ơơi, anó phaai poor jóói nôôq pađiil achêk, piđó ơi palơq aku tajeng tajơl đóng Taruuih Liêm, kung palơq Kơ-lê-man lơq nôôq parjơơk mađó tarnêêng lââng ưng aku, hơq achak ưng piđó dhiq kalóóng Bha-aar Parmông.<verse eid="PHP 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4" />Phaai bhiêk taluôn bhuui marhaal kalóóng Chuôq. Aku e móón dyơq, phaai yuur bhuui marhaal. <verse eid="PHP 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5" />Phaai đóng dyóp ngaai n'nal lóóm moor liêm ưng adhi anó. Chuôq ơi đan aq. <verse eid="PHP 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6" />Óóq karaang marau marâ, Klóóih dhiq ađek, kalóóng dyóp tarnêêng, palơq rau gavơh nhan lơq nhan padhiêr nek palơq rau ma-ơơn, phaai đóng nôôq paraaq gavơh nhan ưng adhi anó bâân praaq pakah leq Yaang Pleng, <verse eid="PHP 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7" />hayơq yươq rauha ưng Yaang Pleng, nek rau jalơh bhơt dyóp rau n'nal, e jư lêi lóóm adhi anó lơq lóóm karnóq ưng adhi anó kalóóng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih.<verse eid="PHP 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8" />Tatun kiêt, nhan móón adhi anó, hơq hau rau nek dhalam lalua, hơq hau rau đaang bhi chap, hơq hau rau bhơt liêm, hơq hau rau sek tabah, hơq hau rau đaang nh'nhơr, hơq hau rau ve haanh liêm, la n'đó rau lóóm liêm, lơq la n'đó rau đaang haanh, nek adhi anó phaai kanóq tơk piđó. <verse eid="PHP 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9" />Nôôq rau adhi anó ơi đuui n'nal, ơi pei katiêu, ơi xâng lơq ơi lêi dhiq aku, nek phaai yuur têêng nôôq rau ađek, hayơq Yaang Pleng yươq rauha e tơơt palơq adhi anó.<verse eid="PHP 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10" />Aku lóng bâân bhuui marhaal kalóóng Chuôq taai ađôk xariêq adhi anó val karaang tơk aku. Bơơi alua, kalóóng chiên ađôk, adhi anó biêh ơi karaang hei tơk aku, bơơi kah ve bhêêl bâân praaq pakah. <verse eid="PHP 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11" />Achêk eh rau nek aku móón leq tabhuch tapiêl ađêi, taai aku ơi đuui phaai iêm lóóm dhơ aku tơơt kalóóng n'đó rau tarlum. <verse eid="PHP 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12" />Aku tame n'nal ngeeo ha-ul, drươh n'nal ve xưa raai. Kalóóng rau yuur avaaih lơq kalóóng rau tarlum, aku ơi đuui tabhơt bhêêl xók bâân kabhôôq lơq xók đơơp ha-ul, palơq bhêêl ve xưa raai lơq xók pâng tabhuch tapiêl. <verse eid="PHP 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13" />Aku ve dyóp praan talum tabhơt ve Yaang têêng đóng aku karơ. <verse eid="PHP 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14" />Dhơ kơi ađek, adhi anó ơi têêng liêm xók ting paak blah hadhơơp janah ưng aku. <verse eid="PHP 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15" />Nhan móón adhi anó kanóón Phi-liip, adhi anó kung n'nal kơi kalóóng vaar tarnââp ưng Taruuih Liêm, xók aku yuur tââi tââq Ma-xê-đoan, kah ve kabhuh akóón dhơn Chuôq ngaai ting paak blah palơq aku kalóóng tarnêêng đóng đơơp, chapiên mưi adhi anó giêl, <verse eid="PHP 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16" />taai dhalam dhiq Tê-sa-lô-ni-ka, adhi anó ơi bơơr pe chu pagơơi ađô parvech tarmông leq aku. <verse eid="PHP 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17" />Achêk eh rau nek aku rââm chik-chêk kaliim, hơq aku rââm chik-chêk bóóng pale n'dhương bơk xưa raai leq phơn malơơi ưng adhi anó. <verse eid="PHP 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18" />Aku xók ve dyóp rau lơq xưa raai dyơq. Aku ơi bâân bơk dyóp, Xók đơơp tââq Ep-ba-phô-đich kliim kaliim bhral tââq adhi anó, nek n'naq thum, nek bhanuôih adhah bâân đơơp đươi, nek rau liêm lóóm Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="PHP 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19" />Yaang Pleng ưng aku e poor đóng bhơt dyóp rau tarmông ưng adhi anó ting rau karvaan ưng Ađó kalóóng rau cha-iil tabah dhiq Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="PHP 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20" />Nhan cha-iil tabah mađó leq Yaang Pleng, Ama nôôq he, đóng tơk nh'chró taluôn. A-meen.<verse eid="PHP 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21" />Nhan pagơơi tham dyóp nôôq manưih huuiq kalóóng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih. Nôôq adhi anó tơơt palơq aku pagơơi tham adhi anó. <verse eid="PHP 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22" />Tabhơt nôôq manưih huuiq pagơơi tham adhi anó, hơq liêm tââm nek nôôq manưih mađó đong Xê-xa.<verse eid="PHP 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23" />Nhan ơơn phươk liêm ưng Chuôq, nek Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih tơơt palơq lóóm yaang adhi anó. A-meen.<verse eid="PHP 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4" />
</usx>